DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_4A4A_248C';
<p>4a4a_248c</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #845011;">Gene B</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #845011;"><i>bumpy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #845011;">Gene B</span> has a skin texture that is not smooth, but rough with small bumps all over.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #116b6c;">Gene M</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #116b6c;"><i>mushy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #116b6c;">Gene M</span> feels soft to the touch and unusually squishy, unlike the usual firmness.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene Y</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #7441a6;"><i>yucky</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene Y</span> gives off an unpleasant odor and has a generally unappealing look.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, mushy, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">13,663</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, mushy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">46,431</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">949</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,180</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,268</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">912</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">45,793</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">13,804</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">130,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>B</b> and <b>Y</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>B</b> and <b>Y</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_4A4A_248C
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(4,180 + 4,268 + 13,663 + 13,804)</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = <sup>35,915</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = 0.2763 = <strong>27.63 cM</strong>
LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(45,793 + 46,431)</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = <sup>92,224</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = 0.7094 = <strong>70.94 cM</strong>
LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(912 + 949 + 13,663 + 13,804)</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = <sup>29,328</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = 0.2256 = <strong>22.56 cM</strong>
LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(912 + 949 + 4,180 + 4,268)</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = <sup>10,309</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = 0.0793 = <strong>7.93 cM</strong>
LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(912 + 949 + 4,180 + 45,793)</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = <sup>51,834</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = 0.3987 = <strong>39.87 cM</strong>
LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(949 + 4,268 + 13,804 + 46,431)</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = <sup>65,452</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = 0.5035 = <strong>50.35 cM</strong>
LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(912 + 949 + 13,663 + 13,804)</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = <sup>29,328</sup>/<sub>130,000</sub> = 0.2256 = <strong>22.56 cM</strong>
LITERAL_4A4A_248C_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
